# ── Operational scripts: TRACKED (deploy + uptime supervision) ────────────────
# /scripts/ used to be ignored wholesale, grouped with the content folders
# above. That was a miscategorisation: these are real operational code — the
# deploy pipeline and the uptime watchdog the live site depends on — and they
# existed on exactly one disk. Verified free of secrets before tracking.
# The content folders above stay ignored; this un-ignores only the scripts.
/scripts/*
!/scripts/*.ps1
!/scripts/*.vbs
# Runtime logs and state markers the watchdog writes — never committed.
/scripts/logs/

